      },
      "eyebrow": "Learn",
      "title": "Verify endpoint convergence",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Recovery includes restoring service and directing clients to the recovered environment. A restored target alone is not verified client convergence.",
          "role": "definition",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#f1"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb1",
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb2"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "First confirm the restored target passes the supplied readiness checks. Perform the approved DNS or application endpoint switch, then verify clients reach the restored target. For DNS, account for cached answers and TTL in those client checks.",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#f2",
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb3",
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb4"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "An updated DNS setting and an old cached client answer can coexist. Keep actual client-target evidence rather than declaring every client moved at the update request. Configuration change is not proof of convergence: verify clients reach the ready restored target, with caching and the supplied TTL accounted for.",
          "role": "misconception",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover"
            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#f2",
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#f3"
            ],
            "teaching_block_ids": [
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb4",
              "recovery.endpoint_cutover#tb5"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagram_kind": "timeline",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "id": "n1",
              "label": "Restored target passes supplied readiness checks"
            },
